      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>A qinah for 7 October and the hostages, to be recited as part of the Tishah b’Av liturgy.</tei:p>
        <tei:p>Note: “<j:divineName>The CAUSE</j:divineName>” is used to translate the Divine Name <j:divineName>YHVH</j:divineName>, based on the philosophical idea of <j:divineName>God</j:divineName> as the <j:divineName>Prime Mover</j:divineName> and on the interpretation of <j:divineName>the Name</j:divineName> as a causative form of the copula – “causes to be.” “<j:divineName>God</j:divineName>” is used to translate the divine name <j:divineName>Elohim</j:divineName>. All divine referents (pronouns, epithets, names) are rendered in unicase.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_63016_introduction"/>
